    {
      "coptic": "ⲁϥϫⲓ ⲛⲇⲁⲩⲉⲓⲇ ⲉⲃⲟⲗ ϩⲛⲛ**ⲟϩⲉ** ⲛⲉⲥⲟⲟⲩ ⲁϥⲁⲁϥ ⲛⲣⲣⲟ ⲉⲡⲉϥⲅⲉⲛⲟⲥ · ⲁⲩⲱ ⲛⲉⲓⲱⲧ ⲙⲡⲙⲩⲥⲧⲏⲣⲓⲟⲛ ⲉⲧϩⲁϩⲟⲧⲉ ·",
      "english": "He took David from a flock of sheep, and made him king of his race, and the father of the Awful Mystery.[1 Sam.16:13]",
      "source": "Proclus Homily 23 On the Nativity in Budge ed.",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:proclus.homily23.budge",
